{"id":"great-blue-hole","name":"Great Blue Hole","qid":"Q86486","country":"Belize","locality":"Belize District","lat":"17.31556","lon":"-87.53444","built":"","year":null,"year_text":"","century":"","era":"Natural formations","period":"","date_basis":"","style":"","heritage":"natural monument; part of UNESCO World Heritage Site","type":"natural monument; blue hole","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Great_Blue_Hole","text":"The Great Blue Hole is a large marine sinkhole off the coast of Belize. It lies near the center of Lighthouse Reef, a small atoll 70 km (43 mi) from the mainland and Belize City. The hole is circular in shape, 318 m (1,043 ft) across and 124 m (407 ft) deep.","text_source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Great_Blue_Hole","text_license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","real":[{"id":"gh-c5b39f83b7ac","w":1200,"h":934,"title":"Great Blue Hole.jpg","o":"gh-c5b39f83b7ac.jpg","credit":{"text":"U.S. Geological Survey (USGS)","license":"Public domain","license_url":"","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Great_Blue_Hole.jpg","via":"Wikimedia Commons"}}],"depictions":[{"id":"civilization-vii--great-blue-hole","game":"civilization-vii","name":"Great Blue Hole","verified":false,"text":"","text_source":"","text_license":"","images":[{"id":"gh-p1621fdafc8c","w":1200,"h":675,"o":"gh-p1621fdafc8c.png","credit":{"text":"Screenshot from Civilization VII, © 2K.","source":"https://civilization.fandom.com/wiki/File:Great_Blue_Hole_in-game_(Civ7).png","via":"Fandom (civilization)","note":"Fandom upload by Jostriker on 2026-06-19"}}]}]}